OL,3,GNEWSAEMR services 'unacceptable', says
OL,4,Atransport secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander has
OL,7,Fapologised for East Midlands Railway
OL,8,F(EMR) services being "unacceptable" due
OL,9,Fto problems with a new fleet of trains.
OL,11,FIssues with the new Aurora (Class 810)
OL,12,Ffleet led to months of delays,
OL,13,Fcancellations and overcrowding on
OL,14,Fservices, as well as strike action by
OL,15,FRMT union members.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
