OL,3,GNEWSAEMR services 'unacceptable', says
OL,4,Atransport secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a visit to Derby on Thursday for
OL,7,Fthe announcement of the location of the
OL,8,Fnew Great British Railways (GBR)
OL,9,Fheadquarters, Alexander said: "I
OL,10,Frecognise people have received an
OL,11,Funacceptable service this summer and I
OL,12,Fapologise for that. It's not good
OL,13,Fenough."
OL,15,FShe also told the BBC the company "must
OL,16,Fimprove" before it is expected to be
OL,17,Frenationalised by the end of 2027.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
